{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/040",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u09282",
   "en": "What happens to your partner after the union?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09283",
   "en": "You asari live for a thousand years. What happens when your partner dies?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09284",
   "en": "Are you going to be okay?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09285",
   "en": "This hurts you, doesn't it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09286",
   "en": "Any chance she's in this for power or personal gain?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09287",
   "en": "I'm glad you're here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09288",
   "en": "I'm busy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09289",
   "en": "It'll be okay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09290",
   "en": "Don't talk like that!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09291",
   "en": "I thought you wanted to wait.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09292",
   "en": "We can wait.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09293",
   "en": "I want this, too.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09294",
   "en": "Now?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09295",
   "en": "Yes!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09296",
   "en": "So were you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09297",
   "en": "Let's go again!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09298",
   "en": "What about the age difference?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09299",
   "en": "Rumors?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09300",
   "en": "That's disgusting!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09301",
   "en": "What about the other parent?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09302",
   "en": "You sound troubled.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09303",
   "en": "Maybe she's just evil.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09304",
   "en": "Commander Shepard. I hope you are not here to check up on me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09305",
   "en": "I feel a bit embarrassed about what happened earlier. You reached out to me as a friend, and I thought it was something more. The mistake was mine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09306",
   "en": "But I would still like to be friends. Can we just put this whole incident behind us?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09307",
   "en": "I suppose I thought our relationship was more than it was. I made a fool of myself in front of you and Alenko. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09308",
   "en": "I suppose I thought our relationship was more than it was. I made a fool of myself in front of you and Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09309",
   "en": "But the mistake was mine. I would still like to be friends... and I would like to put the whole incident behind us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09310",
   "en": "I would appreciate that. Is there something else you wanted to ask me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09311",
   "en": "I wanted to make sure you were doing okay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09312",
   "en": "Why would I do that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09313",
   "en": "I won't mention it again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09314",
   "en": "How are you feeling?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09315",
   "en": "I'm not.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09316",
   "en": "Can't say I blame you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09317",
   "en": "Done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09318",
   "en": "The sheer size of this place is overwhelming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09319",
   "en": "How could anyone live here? There are just so many people!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09320",
   "en": "Even in their ruins, the majesty of the Protheans is evident.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09321",
   "en": "Imagine what this place was like in its glory.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09322",
   "en": "I will be glad when we leave this frozen world behind us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09323",
   "en": "The air here feels foul.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09324",
   "en": "Something about this world unsettles me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09325",
   "en": "Cannot believe we are actually here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09326",
   "en": "Saren must be stopped!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09327",
   "en": "I am ready.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09328",
   "en": "Let us go.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09329",
   "en": "I am with you, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09330",
   "en": "She rarely spoke of her partner, though I know my father--if you want to use that term--was another asari.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09331",
   "en": "Think about it, Shepard. If we were not able to mate with our own species, we would have died out long before we ever mastered space flight and left our homeworld.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09332",
   "en": "Union with our own kind is no longer common. Not for the purposes of reproduction. Most asari believe it weakens our species.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09333",
   "en": "Asari daughters inherit racial traits from the father species. If both parents are asari, then nothing has been gained. Or so conventional wisdom would hold.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09334",
   "en": "I am what is sometimes called a \"pureblood\", though no asari would ever be cruel enough to say the word to my face. It is a great insult among my people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09335",
   "en": "It is possible Benezia's partner was embarrassed by their union. She may have been too ashamed to publicly acknowledge me as her offspring.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09336",
   "en": "You might be right. I hope you are. But I have no way to know for sure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09337",
   "en": "I cannot answer that. This is all speculation on my part. It is possible she wanted to be part of my life, but something happened to her before she had the chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09338",
   "en": "Benezia never spoke of her partner. Whatever happened, it caused her too much pain to dwell on it. She raised me by herself, though that is not uncommon.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09339",
   "en": "Many asari raise their children alone, particularly if the father species is short-lived. Often, the partner will pass on long before the child reaches maturity.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09340",
   "en": "Do you know who Matriarch Benezia chose as her partner?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09341",
   "en": "I thought you always needed another species to serve as one of the parents.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09342",
   "en": "Benezia never told you her partner's name?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09343",
   "en": "Maybe she wanted to meet you but couldn't. Something could have happened to her. Maybe she passed away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09344",
   "en": "How could anyone abandon their own child?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09345",
   "en": "Why agree to the union if she didn't want any children?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09346",
   "en": "Who was your father?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09347",
   "en": "You can do that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09348",
   "en": "You don't know who?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09349",
   "en": "You don't know that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09350",
   "en": "That's terrible!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09351",
   "en": "Then why'd she do it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09352",
   "en": "How do they deal with that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09353",
   "en": "What? No! I did not mean to insinuate-- Ah, I never meant to offend you, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09354",
   "en": "Joking? Oh, by the Goddess! How could I be so dense? You must think I am a complete and utter fool.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09355",
   "en": "I'm sorry if this is awkward for you, Shepard. I'm only trying to be honest. I feel as if we share some type of... connection.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09356",
   "en": "Relax.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09357",
   "en": "I wasn't sure if... are you interested in me, Shepard?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09358",
   "en": "Perhaps I was wrong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09359",
   "en": "There must also be an emotional and spiritual connection. Is there something between us, Shepard? Or was I wrong?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09360",
   "en": "Joker's waiting for you on the bridge, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09361",
   "en": "After what happened to Jenkins, the crew could use some good news. They'll be glad to hear you're okay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09362",
   "en": "I never want to see anything bad happen to a fellow marine, Commander. Let's just leave it at that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09363",
   "en": "I'm not one to hold a grudge. I think we're all looking to put Eden Prime behind us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09364",
   "en": "Sir, you questioned my competence through the entire mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09365",
   "en": "That's fair. Guess I overreacted. I just get a little defensive when someone thinks I can't hold my own.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09366",
   "en": "You didn't. Captain Anderson did. Sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09367",
   "en": "I'm glad you're okay, Commander. The crew could use some good news after what happened to Jenkins.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09368",
   "en": "Captain Anderson had me transferred to his command. Must have figured I knew what I was doing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09369",
   "en": "Captain Anderson had me transferred to his command. I'm just sorry Jenkins had to die for me to get this chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09370",
   "en": "I've seen friends die before. Comes with being a marine. But to see my whole unit wiped out...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09371",
   "en": "And you never get used to seeing dead civilians. But things would have been a lot worse if you hadn't shown up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09372",
   "en": "Thanks, Commander. I have to admit, I was a little worried about being assigned to the Normandy. It's nice when someone makes you feel welcome.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09373",
   "en": "You saved a lot of lives, Commander. It might be hard to keep that in perspective with what happened to Jenkins.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09374",
   "en": "Part of me feels guilty over what happened. If Jenkins was still alive, I might not be here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09375",
   "en": "Thanks, Commander. That means a lot from you. I've never met anyone who was awarded the Star of Terra.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09376",
   "en": "Held off an entire enemy platoon? Alone? With all due respect, Commander, I think you've got somebody watching over you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09377",
   "en": "Thanks, Commander. I appreciate that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09378",
   "en": "That's grim, Commander. I guess I shouldn't be surprised, though. Not after Torfan. That must have been hell.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09379",
   "en": "With all due respect, I'm glad you're on our side.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09380",
   "en": "I won't let the Alliance down, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09381",
   "en": "Do you really believe that, Commander? After what happened to you on Akuze? Are you saying you only survived because of random chance?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09382",
   "en": "With respect, sir, I think you had somebody watching over you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09383",
   "en": "I don't think it's as simple as that, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09384",
   "en": "Sounds like you're disappointed I survived.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09385",
   "en": "I think we got off on the wrong foot, Williams. Maybe we could start again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09386",
   "en": "You have a problem with me, Chief?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09387",
   "en": "We'd just lost a man. I didn't know you or your capabilities. It was a bad time to integrate you into the team.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09388",
   "en": "Best way to stop that is to show me you're competent. But I don't remember inviting you to come back to the ship with us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09389",
   "en": "You're not assigned to this ship.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09390",
   "en": "Things were pretty rough down there. Are you okay?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09391",
   "en": "We couldn't have done it without you, Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09392",
   "en": "Jenkins was a valuable part of this crew.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09393",
   "en": "You're a good soldier, Williams. You belong on the Normandy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09394",
   "en": "There's nothing special about me, Williams. Anyone would have done the same.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09395",
   "en": "When your number comes up, it's over. His did.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09396",
   "en": "Every time you kill, it gets a little easier.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09397",
   "en": "I did what I had to do. You'd better be willing to do the same.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09398",
   "en": "I survived because I refused to die.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09399",
   "en": "Akuze was a bloodbath. Even now, I don't know how I survived. I guess it just wasn't my time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09400",
   "en": "I need to go speak with Joker.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09401",
   "en": "You don't sound glad.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09402",
   "en": "I'm sorry if I upset you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09403",
   "en": "Something wrong?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09404",
   "en": "I overreacted.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09405",
   "en": "That's my prerogative.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09406",
   "en": "Why are you on the Normandy?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09407",
   "en": "He'll be missed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09408",
   "en": "You earned it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_12tali_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09409",
   "en": "I just did my job.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09410",
   "en": "You start to enjoy it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09411",
   "en": "It wasn't luck.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09412",
   "en": "I was lucky.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA30_02B_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09413",
   "en": "Understood, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09414",
   "en": "Thanks, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09415",
   "en": "I think you're going to fit in here just fine, Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09416",
   "en": "Everyone on this ship has to do his or her part, Williams. Remember that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09417",
   "en": "Thanks, Williams. I needed to hear that. I think you're going to fit in here just fine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09418",
   "en": "I'm not looking for a shoulder to cry on, Williams. Just stay focused on your job.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09419",
   "en": "Glad to have you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09420",
   "en": "Don't disappoint me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09421",
   "en": "Save it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09422",
   "en": "Hey, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09423",
   "en": "You had us worried there, Shepard. How are you feeling?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09424",
   "en": "About fifteen hours. Something happened down there with the beacon, I think.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09425",
   "en": "It's my fault. I must have triggered some kind of security field when I approached it. You had to push me out of the way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09426",
   "en": "The beacon exploded. A system overload, maybe. The blast knocked you cold. The Lieutenant and I carried you back here to the ship.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09427",
   "en": "The beacon exploded. A system overload, maybe. The blast knocked you cold. Williams and I had to carry you back here to the ship.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09428",
   "en": "Listen, you're better off in this infirmary than in any hospital on Eden Prime.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09429",
   "en": "Physically, you're fine. But I detected some unusual brain activity, abnormal beta waves.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09430",
   "en": "I also noticed an increase in your rapid eye movement, signs typically associated with intense dreaming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09431",
   "en": "Hmmm. I better add this to my report. It may-- Oh, Captain Anderson.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
